# 16. IMPORTANT FUNCTIONS

### `bind()`

Connects an event to a function.

```python
widget.bind("<KeyPress>", function)
```

### `unbind()`

Removes the event handler.

```python
widget.unbind("<KeyPress>")
```

This is why the Stop button can disable logging.

