# 22. KEYLOGGER VS CLIPBOARD LOGGER

### Keylogger

Records keyboard input.

### Clipboard logger

Monitors copied content.

Example:

```text
Copy API key
     ↓
Clipboard
     ↓
Clipboard monitor
```

Both can expose sensitive data.

---

# 23. KEYLOGGER VS SNIFFER

These are very different.

### Keylogger

```text
Keyboard
   ↓
Input
```

### Network sniffer

```text
Network interface
   ↓
Packets
```

Wireshark is primarily a network packet-analysis tool, not a keylogger.

