# 27. EDR DETECTION

Modern endpoint security can look for suspicious combinations such as:

```text
Unusual process
      +
Keyboard/input monitoring behavior
      +
Persistence
      +
Suspicious file activity
      +
Outbound connection
```

Correlation is stronger than a single indicator.

